WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.902
Now we put a calculation inside the function.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:08.997
Sales and costs are created inside calculate_profit, and the function prints the difference.

00:00:08.997 --> 00:00:14.583
With one thousand in sales and eight hundred in costs, the result is two hundred.

00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:17.609
The limitation is that the numbers are fixed.

00:00:17.609 --> 00:00:20.464
Every call produces the same result.

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:24.399
That leads naturally to the next idea: parameters.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:28.369
Parameters let us keep the calculation but change the inputs.
